  "description": "From city life to wilderness and back again. The HAIBIKE ADVENTR 8.5 bridges the gap between reliable trekking eBike and comfortable full-suspension eMTB. Based on the same frame platform as our off-road ALLTRAIL models, this bike transforms even the dullest commute into a vibrant woodland adventure. The sporty spec helps too: the Bosch Performance Line CX motor powers you through headwinds, the 800Wh battery gives you maximum energy for daily rides, and with 140mm front and 130mm rear travel, this SUV eBike keeps you steady even on rough gravel tracks. Naturally, a sturdy rear rack is included. The perfect choice for urban adventures and spontaneous off-road escapes.",
